SCIENTIFIC DISCLAIMER

Q-Peptide is a computational design tool. All antimicrobial activity and
hemolysis values it produces are MODEL PREDICTIONS from machine-learning models
trained on literature-extracted data. No experimental validation is claimed or
implied. Experimental validation would be required before drawing any
biological conclusion from any output of this software.
